I think that's one of the main points of activism
that I'm aiming for, is really trying to be

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:53.490
have be more self aware and spread the actual
truth with what I can within my own abilities.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:54.750
All right.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.750
Very good.

